      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدنّأهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, incited him to</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَنَآءَة</span> [i. e.
